<title>CHINA: China Hualian '96 sales hit $976 mln.</title>
<headline>China Hualian '96 sales hit $976 mln.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's Shanghai Hualian Co Ltd reported total sales value of 8.1 billion yuan ($976 million) in 1996, up 23.6 percent from the year before, a company official said on Friday.</p>
<p>Hualian's total assets soared by 2.3 billion yuan in 1996 to 4.4 billion yuan, the official said but gave no further details.</p>
<p>--Beijing Newsroom (8610) 6532 1921</p>
</text>
